---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="Sanskar Pandey. Backend and systems engineer who builds things to understand them.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <article style="max-width: 46rem;">
      <section class="hero" style="padding-block: 3.5rem 1rem;">
        <p class="label hero__eyebrow rise rise-1">About</p>
        <h1 class="rise rise-2">Hi, I&rsquo;m Sanskar.</h1>
      </section>

      <div class="prose rise rise-3" style="max-width: 42rem;">
        <p class="big-lede">
          I do backend and systems work, and lately a lot of it is AI and agent
          infrastructure.
        </p>

        <p>
          Most of what&rsquo;s on this site I built to understand how something works, not
          to ship it. A <a href="https://github.com/sanskarpan/btree-engine">B+Tree</a> and
          an <a href="https://github.com/sanskarpan/lsm-tree-storage">LSM-tree</a> engine,
          a <a href="https://github.com/sanskarpan/raft-consensus">Raft</a> implementation,
          a distributed tracing backend, an
          <a href="https://github.com/sanskarpan/promptline">LLM eval pipeline</a>, an
          <a href="https://github.com/sanskarpan/tag-agent">agent runtime</a>. Mostly Go
          and Python. I&rsquo;ve found I don&rsquo;t really understand a system until
          I&rsquo;ve written a rough version of it myself and watched it break.
        </p>

        <p>
          I try to be honest about what these are. Most of them are studies, not
          production databases, and I would rather say that than dress them up. What I
          actually care about is getting the fundamentals right and writing them down
          clearly. That is what this site is for.
        </p>

        <p>
          The writing is in <a href="/writing">/writing</a>, the projects in
          <a href="/projects">/projects</a>, and the half-formed stuff in
          <a href="/notes">/notes</a>. Email is the best way to reach me.
        </p>

        <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/sanskarpan">GitHub</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/sanskarpandey2004">LinkedIn</a></li>
          <li><a href="mailto:sanskar.works.2004@gmail.com">Email</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</Base>
